{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03227","headline":"宿云门寺 · 宋之问","name":"宿云门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云门若邪里，泛鷁路才通。\n夤缘绿筱岸，遂得青莲宫。\n天香衆壑满，夜梵前山空。\n漾漾潭际月，颸飀杉上风。\n兹焉多嘉遯，数子今莫同。\n凤归慨处士，鹿化闻仙公。\n樵路郑州北，举井阿岩东。\n永夜岂云寐，曙华忽葱茏。\n谷鸟啭尚涩，源桃惊未红。\n再来期春暮，当造林端穷。\n庶几踪谢客，开山投剡中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}